# API Endpoints Reference

## Core Endpoints
- `GET /api/health` - Health check
- `GET /api/ping` - Simple ping check

## Video Generation
- `POST /api/moneyprinter/generate` - Generate MoneyPrinter video
- `POST /api/brainrot/generate` - Generate Brainrot video
- `POST /api/brainrot/playlist` - Generate Brainrot playlist

## Job Management
- `GET /api/jobs` - List all jobs
- `GET /api/jobs/{job_id}` - Get specific job status
- `POST /api/jobs/{job_id}/cancel` - Cancel a job
- `GET /ws/jobs/{job_id}` - WebSocket for real-time job updates

## Batch Operations
- `POST /api/batch` - Create batch job
- `POST /api/batch/{batch_id}/start` - Start batch processing
- `GET /api/batch/{batch_id}` - Get batch status
- `GET /api/batch/{batch_id}/results` - Get batch results
- `POST /api/batch/{batch_id}/cancel` - Cancel batch
- `GET /api/batches` - List all batches

## Resources
- `GET /api/models` - Available AI models
- `GET /api/voices` - Available TTS voices
- `GET /api/voice-sample` - Get voice sample audio
- `GET /api/gpu-info` - GPU information

## File Operations
- `GET /api/download` - Download generated videos
- `GET /api/list-videos` - List available videos

## Monitoring & Cache
- `GET /api/metrics` - Application metrics
- `GET /api/metrics/stats` - Metrics statistics
- `GET /api/cache/stats` - Cache statistics
- `POST /api/cache/clear` - Clear cache

## API Conventions
- **Authentication**: Send `X-API-Key` header if `API_KEY` env var is set
- **Rate Limiting**: Configurable per-IP limits via `RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE`
- **CORS**: Configurable via `CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS` (default: "*")
- **WebSocket**: Real-time job progress updates at `/ws/jobs/{job_id}`
- **Response Format**: JSON with consistent error handling